{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"通过此接口，用户可以更新落地页组的基本信息，包括落地页组 ID、名称、URL、状态、流量分配方式等。前置接口为【获取Access-Token】，配合接口有【附录-返回码】【附录-落地页组状态】【附录-落地页组流量分配方式】【附录-落地页站点启用状态】。\",\"id\":\"ad.landing_group.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/landing_group/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710630182912\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，获取方法见该接口文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答参数中的返回码和返回信息详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"},{\"id\":\"ad.landing_group_status.reference\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535#custom-anchor-%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E9%A1%B5%E7%BB%84%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81\",\"reason\":\"应答参数中的落地页组状态详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-落地页组状态\"},{\"id\":\"ad.landing_group_flow_type.reference\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535#custom-anchor-%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E9%A1%B5%E7%BB%84%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F\",\"reason\":\"应答参数中的流量分配方式详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-落地页组流量分配方式\"},{\"id\":\"ad.landing_site_status.reference\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535#custom-anchor-%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E9%A1%B5%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81\",\"reason\":\"应答参数中的站点启用状态详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-落地页站点启用状态\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710630182912\",\"title\":\"更新落地页组信息\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7D4xN455\">通过此接口，用户可以更新落地页组的基本信息。<span style=\"color: #eb1010;\"></span></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-pbKNKtWN\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AHIXK8P0\">落地页组信息会包括落地页组 ID、落地页组名称、落地页组 URL、落地页组状态、流量分配方式； 站点列表信息会包括成员 ID（即站点在落地页组中的唯一标识）、站点 ID、站点URL、站点启用状态、站点审核状态。</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201769847498536964%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-YjUzUYPD\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZVaLRyjT\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/landing_group/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/landing_group/update/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710630182912\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-MR3ygieM\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-8ml3DhNM\">POST</p><h